Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it, gotta go over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.18,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing. No time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.34,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marks maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.88,0:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.14,0:01:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I better grab him and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.66,0:02:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do that much at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.66,0:02:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sham.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Something set my power away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You've caused enough trouble, Trafalgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, just what I need—sea prism\Nstone comes from this land;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it's only natural to Weapons it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,sea prism stone—nail the artisans here\Ncan craft it in such a small scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You must admire their expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.80,0:02:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:03:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get out of here. Now roam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That ability
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,of yours is a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,get very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,out and search for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.17,0:03:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,boy up. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,His spirit will be broken in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he can join us. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention a word about pirates\Nin the notice papers. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The people in this country don't know\Na damn thing about the outside world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and I want to keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.18,0:03:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! Let's go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your gawking and grab his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You have it too, pesky runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That technique, it was\Nthe same as Lord Odin's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can he use it when\Nhe's knocked out cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fancy yourself a conqueror, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too many already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And none of them worth a damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.44,0:05:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with Trafalgar later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sobered up after all that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,C-prism stone nails, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gonna be a real pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.74,0:06:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.18,0:06:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope my crew survive back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you tracked down\NTrafalgar yet? No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been looking all over\Ntown, but he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have made a break for it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on. Cuff him. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Capturing Straw Hat should be\Nsufficient for the time being, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:06:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not be deterred.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide if you must, Trafalgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Caribou!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hang in there, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to treat you now, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd know that voice anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He did so much for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And look what became of\Nall the food he brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to tell him how sorry I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.60,0:07:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy Taro would never blame you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I do worry that when he sees\Nthe sorry state of things here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,he's going to blame himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That man has such a gentle heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Still as beautiful as a painting, you\Nhaven't changed in 20 years. And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not show my face to you until I\Nhave fulfilled the dream of our Lord Odin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.42,0:08:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My darling, please forgive\Nyour selfish husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Ashura Doji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant sinkhole opened\Nup, as you can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.08,0:08:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who can you save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, we all made it out okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I feared the worst had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.82,0:09:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The sinkhole saved us,\Nbut there's one issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, okay, ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That was great, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a strong boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My work is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The ladies are all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.22,0:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was quite harrowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So when Kaido attacked the castle, Shino\Nprotected everyone with her technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.36,0:09:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In that moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,BLAST BREATH!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Brave entitlement jutsu manifests!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My jutsu causes anything that I touch to\Nripen suddenly or to become more mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,One might say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, everything that Chino\Ntouches will spoil and rot away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude now that we're safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me explain some things, oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what happened to Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed he was picking a fight\Nwith Kaido, but that can't be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourselves and listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Does his cruelty know no bounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, she's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We might be spotted here; we should move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of monster would harm a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.46,0:11:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lofitaro's battle in Kuri became big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Special report! Special report!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to want to miss this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the entire land of One-O was talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some news?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder how he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Doug!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So he made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Special reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that such a dangerous madman\Nwas out roaming the streets. Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Madman did what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, some samurai named Luffy Taro\Nhad a fight with Commander Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't like wasabi, don't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.70,0:14:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but I won't tolerate you\Nspitting on other customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How much did you eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, have you even paid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.90,0:15:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat that iron. Beat it flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard work makes strong weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,which means more business and\Nmore riches for the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember your life belongs to Lord Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't serve him,\Nwe'll throw you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you myself if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Udon in the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.20,0:15:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Home to a series of mines\Nand weapon factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where prisoners are forced to slave away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,further lining the Shogun's pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is in there anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.62,0:15:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Creeps me out. Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All they said was stay back and\Nfeed it a poisonous fish once a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but be sure to remove\Nthe bones, freaky right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:15:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing likes poisonous fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at first, the idea was to feed\Nit poisonous an execution method,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but it keeps eating the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not many people have seen what's in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but I hear it's been surviving\Nlike that for quite a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it like a crocodile or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And why do we have to\Nremove the bones from
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the fish if they just want the thing dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why bother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Heinous criminal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be that kid, the crazy one\Nthat took on commander Kaido. Really
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,hope you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,like your new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look so tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.76,0:16:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna let you live after\Nthe stunt you pulled out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, sure that's the right guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When I heard about all the\Nwild stuff he did in Carrot,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of expected him to\Nbe a little more impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude's tiny as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought he'd have a little more\Npresence, like the lead performers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you gonna say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he so weak? No surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but Commander Kaido must have really\Ndone a number on this little moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this isn't nap time. Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's some luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.38,0:18:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll beat that attitude right out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.76,0:18:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearing at the guards on his first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's asking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm teaching you a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.94,0:18:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Grr!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A fishbone came flying out\Nof the cell! What idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.42,0:18:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you gotta\Nremove them first! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell could be in there anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to your new home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you're ready to beg\NCommander Kaido for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be here a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting bright and early!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So sleep tight, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.16,0:19:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I give that shrimp a week before\Nhe's crying and pissing his pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think the boss will\Neven want him after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get even with you, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you!
